    {
      "id": "SG04",
      "finding": "SetStorageGroup switching groups removes the old membership, clears the member reference, copies current old-group settings into local effective settings, then adds the member to the new group and notifies changes. Rejoining the same non-null group is a no-op. Normal helper detachment preserves current shared settings rather than restoring the pre-link local settings.",
      "xml": [],
