    {
      "id": "SG05",
      "finding": "On ordinary member removal, the manager dissolves groups with zero OR one remaining member; the final member is detached using SetStorageGroup(null), preserving current settings. removeIfEmpty:false bypasses this notification for lifecycle transfers. NewGroup itself can temporarily create an empty group. Post-load null pruning does not call this dissolution path, so this is not proof all malformed singleton/empty saves are normalized.",
